        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Gethsamani thangc tat ro,",
            "Thiammei ta akhaengvmei thiu;",
            "Thuakloumeipu ta zauc o,",
            "Kakhang zingc liangmei ganv khou",
            "Karamrianra ta ’muc riu,",
            "Kakumcna huayney thay o.",
            "",
            "2. Latzan kai thangc lay tat ro,",
            "Pou ta tii'khuai bam the,",
            "’khucmei buangc 8^& zangv kan the!",
            "Kalung bakna khaengv kanmei!",
            "Ryanra, zak khang rouh riu",
            "Kakumcna Kross phungc thay o.",
            "",
            "3. Zauclo, Kalv ’ri chyng khou 8^&",
            "Kaphay, baanc, naek khou 8^&,",
            "Zuk guay khou ch ’ryn lyanmei taanv",
            "Ravguangc ^&8 khaenglou kanmei!",
            "\" ’Taw thu luai the !\" he ’king o,",
            "Kakumc nang nic theiclou o.",
            "",
            "4. T ’rou thangc 8^& khwanzingh",
            "guang o,",
            "Kata nziloupui bamv khou,",
            "Ramh guay rimh, rim zingh zing e;",
            "Thou ^&8 kata ry kan cho ?",
            "Khrista ringc thau dat kan the!",
            "’Niw ta nic tiiringclou o."
          ]
        }
      },
